WEBVTT

00:13:58.521 --> 00:14:00.316
and we wait for the gems.

00:14:00.982 --> 00:14:05.315
And the gems are always
the outermost aspects

00:14:05.339 --> 00:14:06.968
of our interviewee's personality.

00:14:06.992 --> 00:14:10.466
And we stitch them together
like medieval monks,

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:14.017
and we leave the normal
stuff on the floor.

00:14:14.927 --> 00:14:17.946
And you know, this is a country
that over-diagnoses

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:21.247
certain mental disorders hugely.

00:14:21.271 --> 00:14:22.613
Childhood bipolar --

00:14:22.637 --> 00:14:26.192
children as young as four
are being labeled bipolar

00:14:26.216 --> 00:14:28.646
because they have temper tantrums,

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:32.384
which scores them high
on the bipolar checklist.